 "cues": [
  {
   "n": 1,
   "para": 0,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "Chapter XVIII.\nLOVER AND HUSBAND"
  },
  {
   "n": 2,
   "para": 1,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "Ah, Madame,” said D’Artagnan, entering by the door which the young\nwoman opened for him,"
  },
  {
   "n": 3,
   "para": 1,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“allow me to tell you that you have a bad sort of\na husband.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 4,
   "para": 2,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“You have, then, overheard our conversation?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 5,
   "para": 2,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "asked Mme. Bonacieux,\neagerly, and looking at D’Artagnan with disquiet."
  },
  {
   "n": 6,
   "para": 3,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“The whole.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 7,
   "para": 4,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“But how, my God?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 8,
   "para": 5,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“By a mode of proceeding known to myself, and by which I likewise\noverheard the more animated conversation which he had with the\ncardinal’s police.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 9,
   "para": 6,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“And what did you understand by what we said?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 10,
   "para": 7,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“A thousand things. In the first place, that, unfortunately, your\nhusband is a simpleton and a fool; in the next place, you are in\ntrouble, of which I am very glad, as it gives me an opportunity of\nplacing myself at your service, and God knows I am ready to throw\nmyself into the fire for you; finally, that the queen wants a brave,\nintelligent, devoted man to make a journey to London for her. I have at\nleast two of the three qualities you stand in need of, and here I am.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 11,
   "para": 8,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "Mme. Bonacieux made no reply; but her heart beat with joy and secret\nhope shone in her eyes."
  },
  {
   "n": 12,
   "para": 9,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“And what guarantee will you give me,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 13,
   "para": 9,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "asked she,"
  },
  {
   "n": 14,
   "para": 9,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“if I consent to\nconfide this message to you?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 15,
   "para": 10,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“My love for you. Speak! Command! What is to be done?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 16,
   "para": 11,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“My God, my God!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 17,
   "para": 11,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "murmured the young woman,"
  },
  {
   "n": 18,
   "para": 11,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“ought I to confide such a\nsecret to you, monsieur? You are almost a boy.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 19,
   "para": 12,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“I see that you require someone to answer for me?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 20,
   "para": 13,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“I admit that would reassure me greatly.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 21,
   "para": 14,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Do you know Athos?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 22,
   "para": 15,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“No.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 23,
   "para": 16,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Porthos?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 24,
   "para": 17,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“No.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 25,
   "para": 18,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Aramis?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 26,
   "para": 19,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“No. Who are these gentleman?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 27,
   "para": 20,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Three of the king’s Musketeers. Do you know Monsieur de Tréville,\ntheir captain?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 28,
   "para": 21,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“Oh, yes, him! I know him; not personally, but from having heard the\nqueen speak of him more than once as a brave and loyal gentleman.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 29,
   "para": 22,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“You do not fear lest he should betray you to the cardinal?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 30,
   "para": 23,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“Oh, no, certainly not!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 31,
   "para": 24,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Well, reveal your secret to him, and ask him whether, however\nimportant, however valuable, however terrible it may be, you may not\nconfide it to me.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 32,
   "para": 25,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“But this secret is not mine, and I cannot reveal it in this manner.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 33,
   "para": 26,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“You were about to confide it to Monsieur Bonacieux,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 34,
   "para": 26,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said D’Artagnan,\nwith chagrin."
  },
  {
   "n": 35,
   "para": 27,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“As one confides a letter to the hollow of a tree, to the wing of a\npigeon, to the collar of a dog.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 36,
   "para": 28,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“And yet, me—you see plainly that I love you.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 37,
   "para": 29,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“You say so.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 38,
   "para": 30,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“I am an honorable man.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 39,
   "para": 31,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“You say so.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 40,
   "para": 32,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“I am a gallant fellow.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 41,
   "para": 33,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“I believe it.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 42,
   "para": 34,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“I am brave.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 43,
   "para": 35,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“Oh, I am sure of that!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 44,
   "para": 36,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Then, put me to the proof.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 45,
   "para": 37,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "Mme. Bonacieux looked at the young man, restrained for a minute by a\nlast hesitation; but there was such an ardor in his eyes, such\npersuasion in his voice, that she felt herself constrained to confide\nin him. Besides, she found herself in circumstances where everything\nmust be risked for the sake of everything. The queen might be as much\ninjured by too much reticence as by too much confidence; and—let us\nadmit it—the involuntary sentiment which she felt for her young\nprotector decided her to speak."
  },
  {
   "n": 46,
   "para": 38,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“Listen,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 47,
   "para": 38,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said she;"
  },
  {
   "n": 48,
   "para": 38,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“I yield to your protestations, I yield to your\nassurances. But I swear to you, before God who hears us, that if you\nbetray me, and my enemies pardon me, I will kill myself, while accusing\nyou of my death.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 49,
   "para": 39,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“And I—I swear to you before God, madame,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 50,
   "para": 39,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said D’Artagnan,"
  },
  {
   "n": 51,
   "para": 39,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“that if I\nam taken while accomplishing the orders you give me, I will die sooner\nthan do anything that may compromise anyone.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 52,
   "para": 40,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "Then the young woman confided in him the terrible secret of which\nchance had already communicated to him a part in front of the\nSamaritaine. This was their mutual declaration of love."
  },
  {
   "n": 53,
   "para": 41,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "D’Artagnan was radiant with joy and pride. This secret which he\npossessed, this woman whom he loved! Confidence and love made him a\ngiant."
  },
  {
   "n": 54,
   "para": 42,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“I go,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 55,
   "para": 42,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said he;"
  },
  {
   "n": 56,
   "para": 42,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“I go at once.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 57,
   "para": 43,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“How, you will go!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 58,
   "para": 43,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said Mme. Bonacieux;"
  },
  {
   "n": 59,
   "para": 43,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“and your regiment, your\ncaptain?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 60,
   "para": 44,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“By my soul, you had made me forget all that, dear Constance! Yes, you\nare right; a furlough is needful.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 61,
   "para": 45,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“Still another obstacle,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 62,
   "para": 45,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "murmured Mme. Bonacieux, sorrowfully."
  },
  {
   "n": 63,
   "para": 46,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“As to that,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 64,
   "para": 46,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "cried D’Artagnan, after a moment of reflection,"
  },
  {
   "n": 65,
   "para": 46,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“I shall\nsurmount it, be assured.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 66,
   "para": 47,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“How so?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 67,
   "para": 48,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“I will go this very evening to Tréville, whom I will request to ask\nthis favor for me of his brother-in-law, Monsieur Dessessart.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 68,
   "para": 49,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“But another thing.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 69,
   "para": 50,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“What?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 70,
   "para": 50,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "asked D’Artagnan, seeing that Mme. Bonacieux hesitated to\ncontinue."
  },
  {
   "n": 71,
   "para": 51,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“You have, perhaps, no money?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 72,
   "para": 52,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“_Perhaps_ is too much,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 73,
   "para": 52,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said D’Artagnan, smiling."
  },
  {
   "n": 74,
   "para": 53,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“Then,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 75,
   "para": 53,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "replied Mme. Bonacieux, opening a cupboard and taking from it\nthe very bag which a half hour before her husband had caressed so\naffectionately,"
  },
  {
   "n": 76,
   "para": 53,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“take this bag.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 77,
   "para": 54,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“The cardinal’s?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 78,
   "para": 54,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "cried D’Artagnan, breaking into a loud laugh, he\nhaving heard, as may be remembered, thanks to the broken boards, every\nsyllable of the conversation between the mercer and his wife."
  },
  {
   "n": 79,
   "para": 55,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“The cardinal’s,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 80,
   "para": 55,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "replied Mme. Bonacieux."
  },
  {
   "n": 81,
   "para": 55,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“You see it makes a very\nrespectable appearance.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 82,
   "para": 56,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“_Pardieu_,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 83,
   "para": 56,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "cried D’Artagnan,"
  },
  {
   "n": 84,
   "para": 56,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“it will be a double amusing affair to\nsave the queen with the cardinal’s money!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 85,
   "para": 57,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“You are an amiable and charming young man,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 86,
   "para": 57,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said Mme. Bonacieux."
  },
  {
   "n": 87,
   "para": 57,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“Be\nassured you will not find her Majesty ungrateful.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 88,
   "para": 58,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Oh, I am already grandly recompensed!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 89,
   "para": 58,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "cried D’Artagnan."
  },
  {
   "n": 90,
   "para": 58,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“I love you;\nyou permit me to tell you that I do—that is already more happiness than\nI dared to hope.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 91,
   "para": 59,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“Silence!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 92,
   "para": 59,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said Mme. Bonacieux, starting."
  },
  {
   "n": 93,
   "para": 60,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“What!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 94,
   "para": 61,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“Someone is talking in the street.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 95,
   "para": 62,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“It is the voice of—”"
  },
  {
   "n": 96,
   "para": 63,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“Of my husband! Yes, I recognize it!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 97,
   "para": 64,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "D’Artagnan ran to the door and pushed the bolt."
  },
  {
   "n": 98,
   "para": 65,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“He shall not come in before I am gone,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 99,
   "para": 65,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said he;"
  },
  {
   "n": 100,
   "para": 65,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“and when I am gone,\nyou can open to him.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 101,
   "para": 66,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“But I ought to be gone, too. And the disappearance of his money; how\nam I to justify it if I am here?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 102,
   "para": 67,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“You are right; we must go out.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 103,
   "para": 68,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“Go out? How? He will see us if we go out.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 104,
   "para": 69,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Then you must come up into my room.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 105,
   "para": 70,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“Ah,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 106,
   "para": 70,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said Mme. Bonacieux,"
  },
  {
   "n": 107,
   "para": 70,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“you speak that in a tone that frightens\nme!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 108,
   "para": 71,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "Mme. Bonacieux pronounced these words with tears in her eyes.\nD’Artagnan saw those tears, and much disturbed, softened, he threw\nhimself at her feet."
  },
  {
   "n": 109,
   "para": 72,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“With me you will be as safe as in a temple; I give you my word of a\ngentleman.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 110,
   "para": 73,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“Let us go,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 111,
   "para": 73,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said she,"
  },
  {
   "n": 112,
   "para": 73,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“I place full confidence in you, my friend!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 113,
   "para": 74,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "D’Artagnan drew back the bolt with precaution, and both, light as\nshadows, glided through the interior door into the passage, ascended\nthe stairs as quietly as possible, and entered D’Artagnan’s chambers."
  },
  {
   "n": 114,
   "para": 75,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "Once there, for greater security, the young man barricaded the door.\nThey both approached the window, and through a slit in the shutter they\nsaw Bonacieux talking with a man in a cloak."
  },
  {
   "n": 115,
   "para": 76,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "At sight of this man, D’Artagnan started, and half drawing his sword,\nsprang toward the door."
  },
  {
   "n": 116,
   "para": 77,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "It was the man of Meung."
  },
  {
   "n": 117,
   "para": 78,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“What are you going to do?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 118,
   "para": 78,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "cried Mme. Bonacieux;"
  },
  {
   "n": 119,
   "para": 78,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“you will ruin us\nall!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 120,
   "para": 79,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“But I have sworn to kill that man!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 121,
   "para": 79,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said D’Artagnan."
  },
  {
   "n": 122,
   "para": 80,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“Your life is devoted from this moment, and does not belong to you. In\nthe name of the queen I forbid you to throw yourself into any peril\nwhich is foreign to that of your journey.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 123,
   "para": 81,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“And do you command nothing in your own name?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 124,
   "para": 82,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“In my name,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 125,
   "para": 82,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said Mme. Bonacieux, with great emotion,"
  },
  {
   "n": 126,
   "para": 82,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“in my name I\nbeg you! But listen; they appear to be speaking of me.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 127,
   "para": 83,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "D’Artagnan drew near the window, and lent his ear."
  },
  {
   "n": 128,
   "para": 84,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "M. Bonacieux had opened his door, and seeing the apartment, had\nreturned to the man in the cloak, whom he had left alone for an\ninstant."
  },
  {
   "n": 129,
   "para": 85,
   "role": "M. Bonacieux",
   "cast": "Auguste Comte",
   "text": "“She is gone,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 130,
   "para": 85,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said he;"
  },
  {
   "n": 131,
   "para": 85,
   "role": "M. Bonacieux",
   "cast": "Auguste Comte",
   "text": "“she must have returned to the Louvre.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 132,
   "para": 86,
   "role": "Rochefort, the man of Meung",
   "cast": "Voltaire",
   "text": "“You are sure,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 133,
   "para": 86,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "replied the stranger,"
  },
  {
   "n": 134,
   "para": 86,
   "role": "Rochefort, the man of Meung",
   "cast": "Voltaire",
   "text": "“that she did not suspect the\nintentions with which you went out?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 135,
   "para": 87,
   "role": "M. Bonacieux",
   "cast": "Auguste Comte",
   "text": "“No,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 136,
   "para": 87,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "replied Bonacieux, with a self-sufficient air,"
  },
  {
   "n": 137,
   "para": 87,
   "role": "M. Bonacieux",
   "cast": "Auguste Comte",
   "text": "“she is too\nsuperficial a woman.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 138,
   "para": 88,
   "role": "Rochefort, the man of Meung",
   "cast": "Voltaire",
   "text": "“Is the young Guardsman at home?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 139,
   "para": 89,
   "role": "M. Bonacieux",
   "cast": "Auguste Comte",
   "text": "“I do not think he is; as you see, his shutter is closed, and you can\nsee no light shine through the chinks of the shutters.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 140,
   "para": 90,
   "role": "Rochefort, the man of Meung",
   "cast": "Voltaire",
   "text": "“All the same, it is well to be certain.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 141,
   "para": 91,
   "role": "M. Bonacieux",
   "cast": "Auguste Comte",
   "text": "“How so?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 142,
   "para": 92,
   "role": "Rochefort, the man of Meung",
   "cast": "Voltaire",
   "text": "“By knocking at his door. Go.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 143,
   "para": 93,
   "role": "M. Bonacieux",
   "cast": "Auguste Comte",
   "text": "“I will ask his servant.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 144,
   "para": 94,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "Bonacieux re-entered the house, passed through the same door that had\nafforded a passage for the two fugitives, went up to D’Artagnan’s door,\nand knocked."
  },
  {
   "n": 145,
   "para": 95,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "No one answered. Porthos, in order to make a greater display, had that\nevening borrowed Planchet. As to D’Artagnan, he took care not to give\nthe least sign of existence."
  },
  {
   "n": 146,
   "para": 96,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "The moment the hand of Bonacieux sounded on the door, the two young\npeople felt their hearts bound within them."
  },
  {
   "n": 147,
   "para": 97,
   "role": "M. Bonacieux",
   "cast": "Auguste Comte",
   "text": "“There is nobody within,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 148,
   "para": 97,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said Bonacieux."
  },
  {
   "n": 149,
   "para": 98,
   "role": "Rochefort, the man of Meung",
   "cast": "Voltaire",
   "text": "“Never mind. Let us return to your apartment. We shall be safer there\nthan in the doorway.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 150,
   "para": 99,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“Ah, my God!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 151,
   "para": 99,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "whispered Mme. Bonacieux,"
  },
  {
   "n": 152,
   "para": 99,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“we shall hear no more.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 153,
   "para": 100,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“On the contrary,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 154,
   "para": 100,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said D’Artagnan,"
  },
  {
   "n": 155,
   "para": 100,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“we shall hear better.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 156,
   "para": 101,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "D’Artagnan raised the three or four boards which made his chamber\nanother ear of Dionysius, spread a carpet on the floor, went upon his\nknees, and made a sign to Mme. Bonacieux to stoop as he did toward the\nopening."
  },
  {
   "n": 157,
   "para": 102,
   "role": "Rochefort, the man of Meung",
   "cast": "Voltaire",
   "text": "“You are sure there is nobody there?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 158,
   "para": 102,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said the stranger."
  },
  {
   "n": 159,
   "para": 103,
   "role": "M. Bonacieux",
   "cast": "Auguste Comte",
   "text": "“I will answer for it,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 160,
   "para": 103,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said Bonacieux."
  },
  {
   "n": 161,
   "para": 104,
   "role": "Rochefort, the man of Meung",
   "cast": "Voltaire",
   "text": "“And you think that your wife—”"
  },
  {
   "n": 162,
   "para": 105,
   "role": "M. Bonacieux",
   "cast": "Auguste Comte",
   "text": "“Has returned to the Louvre.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 163,
   "para": 106,
   "role": "Rochefort, the man of Meung",
   "cast": "Voltaire",
   "text": "“Without speaking to anyone but yourself?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 164,
   "para": 107,
   "role": "M. Bonacieux",
   "cast": "Auguste Comte",
   "text": "“I am sure of it.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 165,
   "para": 108,
   "role": "Rochefort, the man of Meung",
   "cast": "Voltaire",
   "text": "“That is an important point, do you understand?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 166,
   "para": 109,
   "role": "M. Bonacieux",
   "cast": "Auguste Comte",
   "text": "“Then the news I brought you is of value?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 167,
   "para": 110,
   "role": "Rochefort, the man of Meung",
   "cast": "Voltaire",
   "text": "“The greatest, my dear Bonacieux; I don’t conceal this from you.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 168,
   "para": 111,
   "role": "M. Bonacieux",
   "cast": "Auguste Comte",
   "text": "“Then the cardinal will be pleased with me?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 169,
   "para": 112,
   "role": "Rochefort, the man of Meung",
   "cast": "Voltaire",
   "text": "“I have no doubt of it.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 170,
   "para": 113,
   "role": "M. Bonacieux",
   "cast": "Auguste Comte",
   "text": "“The great cardinal!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 171,
   "para": 114,
   "role": "Rochefort, the man of Meung",
   "cast": "Voltaire",
   "text": "“Are you sure, in her conversation with you, that your wife mentioned\nno names?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 172,
   "para": 115,
   "role": "M. Bonacieux",
   "cast": "Auguste Comte",
   "text": "“I think not.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 173,
   "para": 116,
   "role": "Rochefort, the man of Meung",
   "cast": "Voltaire",
   "text": "“She did not name Madame de Chevreuse, the Duke of Buckingham, or\nMadame de Vernet?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 174,
   "para": 117,
   "role": "M. Bonacieux",
   "cast": "Auguste Comte",
   "text": "“No; she only told me she wished to send me to London to serve the\ninterests of an illustrious personage.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 175,
   "para": 118,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“The traitor!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 176,
   "para": 118,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "murmured Mme. Bonacieux."
  },
  {
   "n": 177,
   "para": 119,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Silence!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 178,
   "para": 119,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said D’Artagnan, taking her hand, which, without thinking of\nit, she abandoned to him."
  },
  {
   "n": 179,
   "para": 120,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“Never mind,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 180,
   "para": 120,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "continued the man in the cloak;"
  },
  {
   "n": 181,
   "para": 120,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“you were a fool not to\nhave pretended to accept the mission. You would then be in present\npossession of the letter. The state, which is now threatened, would be\nsafe, and you—”"
  },
  {
   "n": 182,
   "para": 121,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“And I?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 183,
   "para": 122,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“Well you—the cardinal would have given you letters of nobility.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 184,
   "para": 123,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Did he tell you so?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 185,
   "para": 124,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“Yes, I know that he meant to afford you that agreeable surprise.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 186,
   "para": 125,
   "role": "M. Bonacieux",
   "cast": "Auguste Comte",
   "text": "“Be satisfied,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 187,
   "para": 125,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "replied Bonacieux;"
  },
  {
   "n": 188,
   "para": 125,
   "role": "M. Bonacieux",
   "cast": "Auguste Comte",
   "text": "“my wife adores me, and there is yet\ntime.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 189,
   "para": 126,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“The ninny!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 190,
   "para": 126,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "murmured Mme. Bonacieux."
  },
  {
   "n": 191,
   "para": 127,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Silence!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 192,
   "para": 127,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said D’Artagnan, pressing her hand more closely."
  },
  {
   "n": 193,
   "para": 128,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“How is there still time?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 194,
   "para": 128,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "asked the man in the cloak."
  },
  {
   "n": 195,
   "para": 129,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“I go to the Louvre; I ask for Mme. Bonacieux; I say that I have\nreflected; I renew the affair; I obtain the letter, and I run directly\nto the cardinal.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 196,
   "para": 130,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“Well, go quickly! I will return soon to learn the result of your\ntrip.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 197,
   "para": 131,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "The stranger went out."
  },
  {
   "n": 198,
   "para": 132,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“Infamous!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 199,
   "para": 132,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said Mme. Bonacieux, addressing this epithet to her\nhusband."
  },
  {
   "n": 200,
   "para": 133,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Silence!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 201,
   "para": 133,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said D’Artagnan, pressing her hand still more warmly."
  },
  {
   "n": 202,
   "para": 134,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "A terrible howling interrupted these reflections of D’Artagnan and Mme.\nBonacieux. It was her husband, who had discovered the disappearance of\nthe moneybag, and was crying"
  },
  {
   "n": 203,
   "para": 134,
   "role": "M. Bonacieux",
   "cast": "Auguste Comte",
   "text": "“Thieves!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 204,
   "para": 135,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“Oh, my God!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 205,
   "para": 135,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "cried Mme. Bonacieux,"
  },
  {
   "n": 206,
   "para": 135,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“he will rouse the whole quarter.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 207,
   "para": 136,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "Bonacieux called a long time; but as such cries, on account of their\nfrequency, brought nobody in the Rue des Fossoyeurs, and as lately the\nmercer’s house had a bad name, finding that nobody came, he went out\ncontinuing to call, his voice being heard fainter and fainter as he\nwent in the direction of the Rue du Bac."
  },
  {
   "n": 208,
   "para": 137,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“Now he is gone, it is your turn to get out,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 209,
   "para": 137,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "said Mme. Bonacieux."
  },
  {
   "n": 210,
   "para": 137,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“Courage, my friend, but above all, prudence, and think what you owe to\nthe queen.”"
  },
  {
   "n": 211,
   "para": 138,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“To her and to you!”"
  },
  {
   "n": 212,
   "para": 138,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "cried D’Artagnan."
  },
  {
   "n": 213,
   "para": 138,
   "role": "D’Artagnan",
   "cast": "Jules Verne",
   "text": "“Be satisfied, beautiful\nConstance. I shall become worthy of her gratitude; but shall I likewise\nreturn worthy of your love?”"
  },
  {
   "n": 214,
   "para": 139,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "The young woman only replied by the beautiful glow which mounted to her\ncheeks. A few seconds afterward D’Artagnan also went out enveloped in a\nlarge cloak, which ill-concealed the sheath of a long sword."
  },
  {
   "n": 215,
   "para": 140,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "Mme. Bonacieux followed him with her eyes, with that long, fond look\nwith which he had turned the angle of the street, she fell on her\nknees, and clasping her hands,"
  },
  {
   "n": 216,
   "para": 140,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“Oh, my God,”"
  },
  {
   "n": 217,
   "para": 140,
   "role": "Narrator",
   "cast": "Alexandre Dumas",
   "text": "cried she,"
  },
  {
   "n": 218,
   "para": 140,
   "role": "Constance Bonacieux",
   "cast": "George Sand",
   "text": "“protect the\nqueen, protect me!”"
  }
 ]
}